<title>DENMARK: SAS, United Airlines in freight pact.</title>
<headline>SAS, United Airlines in freight pact.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scandinavian Airlines System (SAS) said on Thursday it signed a freight co-operation deal with U.S.-based United Airlines.</p>
<p>It said the deal was the first step in planned closer collaboration between the two airlines on freight transport, linking SAS to United Airlines' extensive freight network in the United States.</p>
</text>
